  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An aegis’s ability to manifest some of his abilities is limited by the power points he has available. His base daily allotment of power points is given on Table: The Aegis. In addition, he receives bonus power points per day<sup>UP</sup> if he has a high Intelligence score, treating his manifester level for the purposes of bonus power points as equal to his class level. His species may also provide bonus power points per day, as may certain feats and items.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aegis#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
